01:01.580 --> 01:05.170
<b>Episode 2: The Dark Summoner is Trapped in a Room</b>

01:03.290 --> 01:05.170
<b>Ancient ruins...</b>

01:05.380 --> 01:08.960
<b>These crystallizations of the
advanced technological civilization</b>

01:05.380 --> 01:10.250
<b>Welcome... Welcome...</b>

01:08.960 --> 01:12.420
<b>from times long past continue to
function to this very day.</b>

01:11.080 --> 01:12.420
<b>Welcome...</b>

01:15.920 --> 01:18.920
<b>How many hours have passed now
since we got trapped in here?</b>

01:20.250 --> 01:21.630
<b>I couldn't say...</b>

01:29.750 --> 01:33.500
<b>It doesn't look like other parties
have ransacked this area just yet.</b>

01:33.500 --> 01:35.420
<b>I'm so excited!</b>

01:36.290 --> 01:39.170
<b>This is yet another example
of God's guidance.</b>

01:39.170 --> 01:42.500
<b>Rather than competing to pillage
from these ruins from the era of God,</b>

01:42.500 --> 01:44.210
<b>we should be sharing them...</b>

01:44.210 --> 01:46.290
<b>What is that, another ridiculous superstition?</b>

01:46.290 --> 01:47.920
<b>What do you mean, superstition?!</b>

01:47.920 --> 01:49.670
<b>Do you want to suffer divine punishment?!</b>

01:50.250 --> 01:52.630
<b>Just try it!
I'll turn the tables right back on you!</b>

01:52.630 --> 01:55.710
<b>Why do you always bite back like that?!</b>

01:55.710 --> 01:56.920
<b>I do not!</b>

01:56.920 --> 01:58.710
<b>You're totally the one who loves biting!</b>

02:00.080 --> 02:01.750
<b>Hey, watch out!</b>

02:01.750 --> 02:02.750
<b>Huh?</b>

02:06.960 --> 02:10.790
<b>I never expected to be trapped in a room
we just happened to wander into...</b>

02:11.500 --> 02:14.750
<b>I went and let my guard down
even though it could have been a trap.</b>

02:17.210 --> 02:22.040
<b>Haru and Eury said they'd go look
for a way out, but, well...</b>

02:23.080 --> 02:25.500
<b>Welcome! Welcome!</b>

02:26.380 --> 02:28.540
<b>Welcome! Welcome!</b>

02:28.540 --> 02:30.380
<b>Haru, over that way!</b>

02:34.540 --> 02:37.750
<b>Are you suffering from any difficulties
at the present moment?</b>

02:45.880 --> 02:50.080
<b>I guess for now, all we can do is
wait here and trust in the two of them.</b>

03:03.790 --> 03:04.880
<b>This is bad!</b>

03:06.040 --> 03:08.580
<b>We're trapped here
in this tiny room all alone...</b>

03:09.000 --> 03:11.420
<b>It feels so lewd!</b>

03:14.500 --> 03:16.130
<b>Oh yeah...</b>

03:16.420 --> 03:19.630
<b>Why did you decide to become
an adventurer, Amona?</b>

03:21.380 --> 03:22.790
<b>Well...</b>

03:28.750 --> 03:33.380
<b>I don't have much time left to teach you...</b>

03:34.290 --> 03:37.830
<b>You'll be left alone yet again...</b>

03:40.130 --> 03:43.540
<b>That's how it will be for you
from here on out, Amona...</b>

03:44.790 --> 03:51.170
<b>Well, I guess I started exterminating
monsters in order to make a living...</b>

03:52.380 --> 03:54.000
<b>What about you?</b>

03:54.670 --> 03:59.330
<b>As a priest, I have a duty to
protect the towns from monsters!</b>

03:59.330 --> 04:00.830
<b>Then one thing led to another...</b>

04:00.830 --> 04:04.170
<b>Hey, do you all have somebody you like?</b>

04:04.170 --> 04:05.420
<b>For me...</b>

04:05.420 --> 04:08.080
<b>Hehe, it's a secret!</b>

04:08.420 --> 04:11.290
<b>Imp?! Why'd you pop out
on your own like that?!</b>

04:11.290 --> 04:13.750
<b>No, why didn't you summon me?!</b>

04:13.750 --> 04:18.540
<b>With a demon's power,
opening such a door is a simple task!</b>

04:18.540 --> 04:20.250
<b>R-really?!</b>

04:20.250 --> 04:21.920
<b>In exchange...</b>

04:21.920 --> 04:25.130
<b>I shall expect a fitting payment, however.</b>

04:25.540 --> 04:26.920
<b>Payment...?</b>

04:26.920 --> 04:30.330
<b>The power of demons
cannot be used without sacrifice.</b>

04:30.330 --> 04:33.210
<b>That's the foundational premise
to being a dark summoner.</b>

04:33.750 --> 04:37.250
<b>In exchange for borrowing their
powerful magic and immense knowledge,</b>

04:37.250 --> 04:39.460
<b>you must make a fair payment.</b>

04:39.830 --> 04:43.040
<b>A contract with a demon.</b>

04:43.420 --> 04:47.420
<b>Then what is your payment, Amona...?</b>

04:48.460 --> 04:51.080
<b>For each summoning,
I have to give him a sheet of seaweed.</b>

04:51.080 --> 04:52.290
<b>What a shabby payment...</b>

04:52.290 --> 04:54.500
<b>Eh?! Seaweed's delicious!</b>

04:54.500 --> 04:55.830
<b>Ah, sorry...</b>

04:56.170 --> 04:58.170
<b>I guess I've got no choice.</b>

04:58.170 --> 04:59.880
<b>This time I'll give you two sheets of...</b>

04:59.880 --> 05:03.130
<b>Such items shall not be enough this time.</b>

05:03.130 --> 05:04.130
<b>Huh?!</b>

05:04.750 --> 05:08.750
<b>What I require shall be
a far more special payment...</b>

05:10.040 --> 05:12.920
<b>The two of you getting down and dirty!</b>

05:12.920 --> 05:13.960
<b>What?!</b>

05:14.290 --> 05:18.080
<b>You haven't had sex for a while
thanks to all the quests lately, right?</b>

05:18.080 --> 05:21.790
<b>So I figured I'd give you an excuse
to let your lust run wild.</b>

05:21.790 --> 05:23.250
<b>I don't need that sort of help!</b>

05:23.250 --> 05:27.460
<b>You demon...!
You intend to laugh at our depravity?!</b>

05:27.460 --> 05:29.170
<b>Depravity?</b>

05:29.170 --> 05:31.920
<b>I am but a samurai who adores
viewing lovey-dovey pervy acts.</b>

05:31.920 --> 05:33.710
<b>You're a real demon!</b>

05:35.540 --> 05:38.750
<b>As a bit of a freebie, I've prepared
a bed for you that should be just right.</b>

05:38.750 --> 05:42.880
<b>Ah, and I'll go ahead and vanish,
so take your time.</b>

05:43.540 --> 05:46.170
<b>Seriously, you're going way too far here!</b>

05:47.460 --> 05:49.130
<b>Damn him...!</b>

05:49.130 --> 05:51.670
<b>You really can't trust demons after all!</b>

05:53.080 --> 05:54.880
<b>That said...</b>

05:54.880 --> 05:56.710
<b>It's true that I've been feeling frustrated</b>

05:56.710 --> 05:58.920
<b>at how we haven't gotten
the opportunity lately...</b>

05:59.750 --> 06:02.960
<b>But if I rush into it first...</b>

06:03.330 --> 06:08.710
<b>It'll be like saying I'm a real
lusty pervert who can't get enough.</b>

06:09.920 --> 06:11.540
<b>This battle...</b>

06:11.540 --> 06:14.420
<b>Will be lost by whoever
makes the first move!</b>

06:15.000 --> 06:25.170
<b>Commentator</b>

06:15.460 --> 06:17.790
<b>Good evening, all you lovers of
sloppy makeouts nationwide!</b>

06:17.790 --> 06:20.750
<b>I'm Imp, and I'll be
your commentator!</b>

06:20.750 --> 06:24.830
<b>Which one of these two shall be
crowned king of the perverts?!</b>

06:25.630 --> 06:29.880
<b>As a servant of God,
I can't allow myself to be defeated!</b>

06:29.880 --> 06:32.380
<b>Y'know...</b>

06:33.040 --> 06:36.080
<b>This room is pretty hot, isn't it?</b>

06:36.080 --> 06:39.960
<b>Ooh, and Amona goes on the attack!</b>

06:41.500 --> 06:45.080
<b>This must be having
quite the impact on Roni!</b>

06:45.790 --> 06:48.080
<b>It just won't open, will it?</b>

06:49.630 --> 06:51.380
<b>This door...</b>

06:51.880 --> 06:54.540
<b>There it is! The devilish Dempsey Roll!</b>

06:54.540 --> 06:58.960
<b>Will Roni be able to withstand
this voluptuous movement?!</b>

07:00.130 --> 07:01.710
<b>It's hitting him hard!</b>

07:04.000 --> 07:07.330
<b>I have a clear advantage
in terms of weaponry!</b>

07:07.330 --> 07:10.210
<b>Come on then, unleash your inner beast!</b>

07:15.250 --> 07:19.630
<b>Roni has taken the strategy of using
his own clothing to craft a blindfold!</b>

07:19.630 --> 07:24.040
<b>It's a perfect defense against
any and all visual temptations!</b>

07:24.920 --> 07:28.170
<b>And even if unintended,
it's proving effective against Amona!</b>

07:28.170 --> 07:31.080
<b>A truly impressive stance,
combining both offense and defense!</b>

07:31.080 --> 07:33.710
<b>Has Amona fallen behind?!</b>

07:34.670 --> 07:39.290
<b>Ooh, and now Amona is boldly
choosing to close the distance!</b>

07:40.460 --> 07:42.960
<b>Why are you holding back?</b>

07:43.290 --> 07:46.540
<b>Even though you want to hurry up and do it.</b>

07:46.540 --> 07:51.880
<b>You want to just really go for it, don't you?</b>

07:52.540 --> 07:55.000
<b>Folks, we're seeing a whispered words attack!</b>

07:55.000 --> 07:56.880
<b>Surely this is a foul!</b>

07:56.880 --> 07:58.630
<b>Who is the true pervert?!</b>

07:59.290 --> 08:01.500
<b>Roni is trying his hardest to defend,</b>

08:01.500 --> 08:03.750
<b>but his restraint has hit
the point of complete collapse!</b>

08:03.750 --> 08:07.580
<b>Is the goddess of perviness
smiling upon Amona?!</b>

08:11.960 --> 08:13.920
<b>And he's removed his blindfold!</b>

08:13.920 --> 08:16.250
<b>Is this match at an end?!</b>

08:22.250 --> 08:24.080
<b>I'm sorry, Amona!</b>

08:24.080 --> 08:26.080
<b>This is the most I can manage!</b>

08:26.330 --> 08:29.960
<b>You're always doing things for me,</b>

08:29.960 --> 08:33.790
<b>so I wanted to do something
to return the favor.</b>

08:34.040 --> 08:37.540
<b>But I couldn't think of anything
but hugging you like this!</b>

08:38.920 --> 08:40.630
<b>A-Amona...?</b>

08:43.420 --> 08:45.380
<b>U-um...</b>

08:47.790 --> 08:50.080
<b>So half-hearted...</b>

08:51.540 --> 08:55.960
<b>There's no way that would be
enough to satisfy me!</b>

08:56.290 --> 08:59.130
<b>A-Amona...! Ah!</b>

08:59.130 --> 09:01.170
<b>We have a shocking comeback!</b>

09:01.170 --> 09:05.380
<b>Amona has been crowned
