09:05.380 --> 09:09.460
<b>I'll see you again when it's
time for the next match!</b>

09:09.790 --> 09:11.000
<b>Ah...</b>

09:12.750 --> 09:14.130
<b>Amona...!</b>

09:18.380 --> 09:19.630
<b>Amona...!</b>

09:26.420 --> 09:30.170
<b>That little bit of licking is enough
to get you this worked up?</b>

09:30.170 --> 09:32.130
<b>You pervy priest!</b>

09:38.670 --> 09:40.080
<b>You stink...</b>

09:40.830 --> 09:44.250
<b>I can't help that.
We're in the middle of a quest...!</b>

09:46.920 --> 09:48.960
<b>Ah, that's...!</b>

09:49.210 --> 09:52.670
<b>You're so noisy! Just be silent for a bit!</b>

09:53.000 --> 09:55.000
<b>S-sorry...</b>

10:02.460 --> 10:03.790
<b>A-Amona?</b>

10:04.380 --> 10:06.130
<b>What are you doing...?</b>

10:09.920 --> 10:12.540
<b>You can't do stuff like that, Amona!</b>

10:16.170 --> 10:18.670
<b>Why are you the only one coming?</b>

10:21.170 --> 10:23.540
<b>Show me a fun time too!</b>

10:29.080 --> 10:32.380
<b>Amona, I want you to find...</b>

10:33.420 --> 10:35.920
<b>the place that you belong.</b>

10:36.420 --> 10:39.830
<b>Alongside someone who will treasure you...</b>

10:43.330 --> 10:44.960
<b>Amona! Roni!</b>

10:44.960 --> 10:48.330
<b>Thank goodness!
The door opened up, huh?!</b>

10:56.250 --> 10:57.790
<b>What's with that bed?</b>

11:07.580 --> 11:09.750
<b>Suki kirai? Wakkannai</b>

11:09.750 --> 11:11.880
<b>Doushitai? Soba ni itai</b>

11:11.880 --> 11:15.880
<b>Sono nukumori hanashitakunai</b>

11:16.830 --> 11:21.290
<b>Mada hayai? Aitai shiritai sono omoi</b>

11:21.290 --> 11:24.710
<b>Demo kuchizuke wa ima ja nai</b>

11:26.210 --> 11:28.460
<b>Kono mama no futari ja dame ka na?</b>

11:28.460 --> 11:30.790
<b>Fureru dake ja tarinai ka na?</b>

11:30.790 --> 11:34.790
<b>Atatakai jikan kimi o dakishimete ita</b>

11:36.250 --> 11:42.000
<b>Kimi ga hoshii zenbu hoshii yo da kara ne</b>

11:42.000 --> 11:45.000
<b>Suki ni shite iin da yo</b>

11:45.540 --> 11:51.380
<b>Dare ka janakute kimi ga ii no ni ienai</b>

11:51.380 --> 11:54.960
<b>Fukaku kakureta "I love you"</b>

11:54.960 --> 12:00.830
<b>Kitto yobidasu kara mada naisho</b>
